### GET /api/admin/topics
# Topics with eventCount and lastEventAt. Optional filter: ?status=pending|approved|blocked
# Sorted by creation time, newest first; ?order=asc for oldest first.

### All topics
GET {{adminUrl}}/api/admin/topics
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Pending topics (moderation queue)
GET {{adminUrl}}/api/admin/topics?status=pending
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Oldest first
GET {{adminUrl}}/api/admin/topics?order=asc
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Missing token -> 401
GET {{adminUrl}}/api/admin/topics
